meta {
  name: Go Microservices with OpenTelemetry
  type: collection
  version: 2.0
}

docs {
  # Go Microservices with OpenTelemetry API Collection
  
  This collection contains API requests for testing the refactored microservices with comprehensive OpenTelemetry integration.
  
  ## Services
  
  ### Order Service (Port 8080)
  - **Create Order**: POST /orders - Create a new order
  - **Health Check**: GET /health - Service health status
  - **Readiness**: GET /ready - Service readiness probe
  - **Metrics**: GET /metrics - Prometheus metrics endpoint
  
  ### Notification Service (Port 8081)
  - **Get Notification**: GET /notifications - Get notification endpoint
  - **Health Check**: GET /health - Service health status
  - **Readiness**: GET /ready - Service readiness probe
  - **Metrics**: GET /metrics - Prometheus metrics endpoint
  
  ## Observability Stack
  
  - **Prometheus**: http://localhost:9090 - Metrics collection and querying
  - **Jaeger**: http://localhost:16686 - Distributed tracing UI
  - **Grafana**: http://localhost:3000 - Dashboards and visualization
  
  ## Features
  
  -  Distributed tracing with correlation IDs
  -  Prometheus metrics with custom business metrics
  -  Structured logging with trace context
  -  Health checks and readiness probes
  -  Graceful shutdown handling
  -  Production-grade error responses
}